{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S06、S13的感受信息比较密集，扫读不如Y轻松，尤其容易让人顾着读而忽略音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"整体选X。它用加亮的关键短语帮助观众迅速抓住每段心理变化，又用随音乐出现的具体感受补足人物的身体反应、情绪层次和音乐细节；尤其是从怀念亲近、重新想起委屈，到承认两者都真实存在，最后带着想念继续生活，前后的心理转变比较完整。Y的叙述更顺畅、更容易扫读，但右侧感受有些概括化，部分微妙的情绪变化和音乐表现被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "315803a6-604c-41f4-b693-3bae06f7c965", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002137458269Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.204, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:22:36.673544+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0ea8e1871e9798c7704bd269aa9f497cde8b8b4d2d38b6617d9b08ced7a58bd6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2